    "text": "cloudtbirds.com\nwebsite\nCloud County, Kansas\nCloud County Volleyball Team to Make Season Debut in Black v. Gold Scrimmage\nBy Toby Nosker, Sports Information Director,\n9 hours agoThe Cloud County Community College volleyball team, under third year head coach Hilta Ramos, begins its 2025 season with the annual Black v. Gold Scrimmage on Thursday, August 14 at 6:30 pm in Arley Bryant Gymnasium. For the scrimmage, the T-Birds will compete in the best three-out-of-five sets format. The...",
